mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xbBvmDRI42YawxgSCrQibaCxpvOibQibBPibptodnXqkFJ3vaEGEDnGYWpm2yHsTjf5pG9MHZ52hiaxDL9FDrtJrMqQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xbBvmDRI42YawxgSCrQibaCxpvOibQibBPibibDcUgtU0Y72ZfY7ibnVf5k9K4Z3BK9I4GWO8YwQW1NuwB7UW2FaHugw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/52M3CZL3ziabymlTX37cu6iaRb5aZCrib2l1LXoU68l1m3fWXkdibUqwibkJj4aXYnxbsdVpO6Kmwh3TZ09rDFBsmkg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/52M3CZL3ziabymlTX37cu6iaRb5aZCrib2l1LXoU68l1m3fWXkdibUqwibkJj4aXYnxbsdVpO6Kmwh3TZ09rDFBsmkg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/52M3CZL3ziabymlTX37cu6iaRb5aZCrib2l1LXoU68l1m3fWXkdibUqwibkJj4aXYnxbsdVpO6Kmwh3TZ09rDFBsmkg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>邀请函</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>珠江之滨，湾区核心，南方医科大学第二临床医学院（珠江医院）欢迎全国高校优秀学子共赴医学之约！这里是：</span></strong></p><p><span><span>* 全国首批三级甲等医院、广东省高水平医院</span></span></p><p><span><span>* 广东省公立医院改革与高质量发展示范医院</span></span></p><p><span><span>* 广东省首批高水平临床医学院重点建设单位</span></span></p><p><span><span>* 广东省中西医协同“旗舰”医院</span></span></p><p><span><span>* 全国三级公立医院绩效考核A+等级</span></span></p><p><span><span>* 广东省、广州市临床研究质量控制中心牵头单位</span></span></p><p><span><span>* 首批广州市研究型医院联盟单位</span></span></p><p><span><span>* 国家级、省级临床重点专科23个</span></span></p><p><span><span>临床与病原微生物一体化诊疗技术、颅内动脉瘤及脑动静脉畸形介入、房颤射频消融、复杂冠心病介入、前列腺微创诊疗、膀胱再造技术、造血干细胞移植、妇科肿瘤微创诊疗、数字化肝胆外科、听力重建技术、昏迷促醒、胎儿医学与产前诊断技术、心衰治疗+冠脉搭桥及人工心室辅助技术处于华南领先、国内先进水平。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F1R6nJszmHsRjEnb1dMVNZSr88Ox6dRXFuAwWvtEP8zqSZfqtd7oYRVviaaw4KZkwOdAYWadObmfic9v5KXKPDOQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>* 全国首批住院医师规范化培训基地，住培专业基地26个，国家级、省级重点专业基地8个</span></p><p><span>* 国家级培训平台14个、省部级科研平台17个</span></p><p><span>* 国家、省部级科研奖励200余项</span></p><p><span>    国家自然科学基金立项数稳居全国医院前30</span></p><p><span>* 名医名家汇聚，高级职称专家500余名，研究生导师350余人</span></p><p><span>* 一流科教平台：临床研究中心、转化医学研究中心、实验动物中心、临床生物样本资源中心超2.5万㎡，临床技能中心4000㎡</span></p><p><span>* 首次执业医师资格考试通过率、住培结业考核通过率位居全国、全省前列</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>这里，有大师云集的学术盛宴；这里，有志同道合的伙伴同行；这里，有挑战自我的成长机遇！期待全国优秀医学追梦者，在火热的七月，来到属于你的舞台！</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/11MxewEtbQcccibUsgzD6o04JalbsqsTCha0FogDFCk87Xc2HB7k3NEiaJoY6cX60MY7VXycJEA7uYSqTFlR9LuQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/G5z961vACOJYLohKKhHMC68SM8DPnzMMvYdvSmuwX7B0fmChJXvwNVtXvqXcVfDPjXnqrC4nRhzv0YKKshuHiaw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>“游学南医-二临”科研体验行</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>出发！</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/G5z961vACOJYLohKKhHMC68SM8DPnzMMTPKgnlgmIEd8EqicBZhEYF9tMD6DQRxMy2WkkEGhJost79P1hCuL8icQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F1R6nJszmHsRjEnb1dMVNZSr88Ox6dRXAJRibhyDeiaxnDKApeTibVW6WyNOnfWcicwxQPIyv47f37GX9ia4Dog1ibkw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>为加强全国各高校优秀临床医学生与南方医科大学第二临床医学院（珠江医院）各学科及导师之间的了解和交流，给广大优秀临床医学生提供更多学习机会，南方医科大学第二临床医学院（珠江医院）定于2025年7月3-5日在广州举办全国优秀大学生“游学南医-二临”科研体验行活动。活动报名从即日起至6月27日，欢迎来自全国各高校符合条件的2026届本科毕业生踊跃参加。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>一</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>研究生导师队伍</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span>（一）南方医科大学研究生院网站：https://yjsxt.smu.edu.cn/Open/TutorList.aspx</span></p><p><span>（二）第二临床医学院(珠江医院)网站：https://www.zjyy.com.cn/template/education/graduateStudent.html?fd_branchId=368</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>二</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span>（一）全国各高校临床医学、儿科学、眼视光学（五年）、医学影像学(五年)、麻醉学(五年)专业2026届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>（二）热爱社会主义祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法；在读期间，具有良好的品行，无违法违纪行为。</span></p><p><span>（三）本科阶段总成绩排名在该校同年级本专业前30％之内（特别优秀者可酌情放宽），或平均成绩80分以上（GPA3.0以上）。</span></p><p><span>（四）积极参加临床及科研学习，具有较强动手能力和较好科研潜质，有志于从事医学领域实践及科学研究工作，满足以下条件之一者可优先：有科研相关经历、发表论文、申请专利或在科技创新研究方面有突出表现者；参加校级以上挑战杯、互联网+、临床思维类或技能类竞赛、辩论赛三等奖以上获奖者。</span></p><p><span>（五）具有良好的外语水平。满足下列条件之一者可优先：</span></p><ol><li><p><span>英语四级≥500分</span></p></li><li><p><span>六级≥450分</span></p></li><li><p><span>雅思≥6.0分</span></p></li><li><p><span>托福≥90分</span></p></li><li><p><span>全国性英语比赛三等奖以上获得者。</span></p></li></ol><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>三</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请流程</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）在线申报：</span></strong></p><p><span>登陆南方医科大学“2025年游学南医科研体验行报名系统”https://yjszs.smu.edu.cn/MasterX/Signin.aspx。根据指引要求，上传相关资料。</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）上传资料：</span></strong></p><p><span>材料须真实有效，因信息错误与虚假造成的后果，由申请人承担。</span></p><ol><li><p><span><span>2025年“游学南医-二临”科研体验行活动申请表（必需项）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>学生证（必需项）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>个人简历（必需项）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>本科阶段成绩单及同年级总成绩排名表（由教务部门或院系盖章，必需项）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>英语水平证明（四六级或雅思托福证书等，必需项）；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>本科阶段重要获奖证明；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>论文发表、科研成果、学术产出等证明；</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>其他个人业绩材料补充。</span></span></p></li></ol></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>四</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span>申请时间：即日起-2025年6月27日</span></p><p><span>活动时间：2025年7月3-5日</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>五</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>活动要求</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span>（一）体验行学员报到后，须全程参加第二临床医学院相关活动。</span></p><p><span>（二）活动期间，组织安排学科导师座谈交流会，学员可自选学科参加。</span></p><p><span>（三）学科为表现优秀的同学颁发“优秀学员证书”。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/F1R6nJszmHsRjEnb1dMVNZSr88Ox6dRXwK0ZiaMycbEnlZ8Mbm0sVjblkR6BhSYmgJFWCVaJIMdeDR93V0xVkHQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>六</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>活动支持</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span>（一）为学员提供精美纪念品。</span></p><p><span>（二）为学员提供活动期间食宿（本校、本市学生不提供住宿）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F1R6nJszmHsRjEnb1dMVNZSr88Ox6dRXsF2BpkOPBYcATZXxBj6ic2B4frgI9j5WnibbiaZbWUmCIxJneQibaHgycw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>期待您的加入！</span></p><p><span>“游学南医-二临”体验行咨询Q群：878397651</span></p><p><span>联系人：袁老师、蓝老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：020-61643050</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F1R6nJszmHsRjEnb1dMVNZSr88Ox6dRXsF2BpkOPBYcATZXxBj6ic2B4frgI9j5WnibbiaZbWUmCIxJneQibaHgycw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/F1R6nJszmHsRjEnb1dMVNZSr88Ox6dRX4mvVCia6980K6R1lzWYFtP0sIVFdCTmNAXNGLBUJOIGxZ01VOtFwHag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span>  南方医科大学珠江医院</span></p><p><span>（第二临床医学院）教务处</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>  官方订阅号</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>作者：李乐平</span></p><p><span>审核：谢小燕</span></p><p><span>排版：欧阳国辉</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"3743f3e8b55e1f40ab00fa063af9add247c9938224a0ea1ed32d61759cf1fd28","textLength":1935,"sourceSha256":"b679b157974350ee84339e368b64b3cb010f7b9cef4e7589221577ac1193bc8c","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-330f571b0df020fae7f1","title":"2025年南方医科大学第二临床医学院（珠江医院）邀您共赴医学之约","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:52.239931+00:00"}
